    "unshakeable_b_advocates": [
      "Colleagues 1, 10, 12, 17: Relentless combinatorial purists who view any rounding as anathema. Do not waste effort trying to convert them directly; focus on creating doubt among the former D-supporters (3, 11, 18)."
    ]
